  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pskov self-governance ph1</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Pskov sj&#xE4;lvstyre fas 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pskov Oblast Administration has requested a project on local self- governance in the Oblast. Mr Carl Fredriksson made an expert mission to Pskov and drafted a report, recommending that focus be on economic growth. The County Council, County Administrative Board, Invest In Dalecarlia Agency and Research Council in Dalecarlia are the Swedish counterpart. They will visit Pskov in May or June 2003.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Pskovs oblasts Administration har gjort en framst&#xE4;llan om ett projekt om lokalt sj&#xE4;lvstyre i oblasten. Carl Fredriksson gjorde en expert- mission till Pskov och en rapport, d&#xE4;r han rekommenderar att fokus blir p&#xE5; ekonomisk tillv&#xE4;xt. Landstinget, l&#xE4;nsstyrelsen, Invest in Dalecarlia Agency och Forskningsr&#xE5;det i Dalarna &#xE4;r svensk motpart. De kommer att bes&#xF6;ka Pskov i maj eller juni 2003.</narrative>
  </description>
